# Model sources
# The runner rigs and their animation clips are 122 MB of FBX. Only the 6.9 MB of GLBs they convert
# to is kept in git; `tools/fbx-to-glb.mjs` rebuilds those from the sources on disk.
models/**/*.fbx
# The roadside packs are 107 MB of glTF scenes and 2048² textures. Only the 2.9 MB of props cooked out
# of them is kept, and `tools/cook-props.mjs` rebuilds those. Their `license.txt` files are *not*
# ignored: all three packs are CC-BY, so the attribution travels with the models in git.
models/*/scene.gltf
models/*/scene.bin
models/*/textures/
# Sound sources
# The music bed ships as the 96 kbps encode (`sounds/bgm.mp3`, 1.4 MB); the 256 kbps download it was
# made from is 3.7 MB and stays on disk, out of git. Re-encode with (any ffmpeg with libmp3lame):
#   ffmpeg -i sounds/alba_mac-game-176807.mp3 -map_metadata -1 -codec:a libmp3lame -b:a 96k sounds/bgm.mp3
sounds/alba_mac-game-176807.mp3
reference/